                <pb facs="0665" n="567" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg567"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 5 in No. 234.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Chamberlain to High Commissioner Sir Alfred
                        Milner.</hi></head>
                <p>Prime minister has assured United States ambassador that American owners of any
                    part, of cargo of <hi rendition="#italic">Mashona</hi> may have it on proof of
                    ownership and that there is no allegation that the cargo is contraband. You
                    should inform colonial attorney-general to this effect.</p>
            </div>
